				 <i><span class="en">
					Str.
					15.1.42
				</span></i>
			: in Medicine, <i>demarcate</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.72
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				2.112
			</span></i>; also, <i>detach from gums all round</i>, 
